%% Request Flow Diagram (Mermaid)
%% Shows the complete flow of a request through the system

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as FastAPI Server
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Router as Task Router
    participant Quality as Quality Checker
    participant Claude as Claude Code
    participant Local as Local LLM
    participant Tools as Tool Manager
    participant GitHub as GitHub API
    participant Docker as Docker

    Note over User,Docker: Example: "Build and deploy a REST API"

    User->>API: POST /api/chat
    API->>Orch: process_request()

    %% Routing Phase
    Orch->>Router: route(message)
    Router->>Router: Analyze patterns
    Router->>Router: Classify task category
    Router->>Router: Calculate confidence scores
    Router-->>Orch: RoutingDecision<br/>(provider=Claude Code, confidence=0.9)

    Note over Orch: Selected: Claude Code (Primary)<br/>Fallback: Claude

    %% LLM Execution Phase
    Orch->>Claude: complete(messages, tools)
    Note over Claude: Generate response with tool calls
    Claude-->>Orch: LLMResponse<br/>(content + tool_calls)

    %% Tool Execution Phase
    Note over Orch,Docker: Execute tool calls
    Orch->>Tools: execute_tools(tool_calls)

    par GitHub Operations
        Tools->>GitHub: create_repository()
        GitHub-->>Tools: repo_url
    and Docker Operations
        Tools->>Docker: build_image()
        Docker-->>Tools: image_id
        Tools->>Docker: run_container()
        Docker-->>Tools: container_id
    end

    Tools-->>Orch: tool_results[]

    %% Final Response Phase
    Note over Orch: Get final response with tool results
    Orch->>Claude: complete(messages + tool_results)
    Claude-->>Orch: final_response

    %% Quality Check Phase
    Orch->>Quality: check(response)
    Quality->>Quality: Validate length
    Quality->>Quality: Check patterns
    Quality->>Quality: Calculate score
    Quality-->>Orch: QualityCheck(passed=true, score=0.95)

    %% Response
    Orch-->>API: ChatResponse
    API-->>User: JSON Response<br/>(message, provider, tools_executed)

    Note over User: Receives: Code + Deployed Service
